        "y1": 0.7134845618045691
      },
      "text": "1.1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16764381508422055,
        "y0": 0.6983896120630129,
        "x1": 0.35411525551789724,
        "y1": 0.7134845618045691
      },
      "text": "Majority Dynamics",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764368044784645,
        "y0": 0.7292558930136941,
        "x1": 0.8823496625314351,
        "y1": 0.7430300086435646
      },
      "text": "Consider a parliamentary election with two parties. The election season begins with Day 0, where",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764366798151553,
        "y0": 0.750013221393932,
        "x1": 0.8827412923177084,
        "y1": 0.7637873370238024
      },
      "text": "each voter supports one side. At the end of every day, each voter polls their friends, then supports",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764366798151553,
        "y0": 0.7707705497741699,
        "x1": 0.8850954342511744,
        "y1": 0.7845446654040404
      },
      "text": "the majority side the next morning, or keeps their affiliation in case of a tie. On election day, every-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764366798151553,
        "y0": 0.7915283790742508,
        "x1": 0.8829376619625715,
        "y1": 0.8053024947041213
      },
      "text": "one votes for the party they currently supports and the parliament will be divided proportionally",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11705540675742954,
        "y0": 0.8122857074544887,
        "x1": 0.37489887312346815,
        "y1": 0.8260598230843592
      },
      "text": "with each side’s number of votes.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14529086094276578,
        "y0": 0.8330435367545697,
        "x1": 0.8821537915398093,
        "y1": 0.8468176523844401
      },
      "text": "This process can be modeled with a graph process, where vertices represent voters and edges",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764376771216299,
        "y0": 0.8538008651348076,
        "x1": 0.28552256066814746,
        "y1": 0.867574980764678
      },
      "text": "represent friendships.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2984279807096992,
        "y0": 0.8538008651348076,
        "x1": 0.7929720161787046,
        "y1": 0.867574980764678
      },
      "text": "We let Red and Blue, or R and B, stand for the two parties.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8062695771260978,
        "y0": 0.8538008651348076,
        "x1": 0.8821518841911765,
        "y1": 0.867574980764678
      },
      "text": "The state",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764376771216299,
        "y0": 0.8745581935150455,
        "x1": 0.6025822458703534,
        "y1": 0.888332309144916
      },
      "text": "of affiliations at any time is simply a coloring on the graph.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6158798317504085,
        "y0": 0.8745581935150455,
        "x1": 0.8821526820363562,
        "y1": 0.888332309144916
      },
      "text": "This process on a graph is called",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764376771216299,
        "y0": 0.8953160228151263,
        "x1": 0.7207797680025786,
        "y1": 0.9090901384449969
      },
      "text": "Majority Dynamics in literature, due to the majority-based updating rule.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49548688901016136,
        "y0": 0.9330434221209902,
        "x1": 0.5043104084488613,
        "y1": 0.9468175377508606
      },
      "text": "1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "other",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
